## 🟢 1️⃣ LOGICAL FUNCTIONS

| Function | Easy Meaning       | What it Validates                     | Rule Example                          | **Example Explained (Ex Define)**             |
| -------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| AND()    | Sab condition true | Multiple conditions ek sath true hain | `AND(IsClosed, ISBLANK(Reason__c))`   | Record close hai aur reason blank hai → error |
| OR()     | Koi ek true        | At least ek condition match           | `OR(Amount < 10, Amount > 1000)`      | Amount bahut kam ya bahut zyada → error       |
| NOT()    | Condition ulta     | Invalid value ko block                | `NOT(ISNUMBER(Pincode__c))`           | Pincode number nahi hai → error               |
| IF()     | Agar/warna logic   | Conditional rule follow               | `IF(Amount > 100000, TRUE, FALSE)`    | Amount 1L se zyada → error                    |
| CASE()   | Multiple values    | Picklist value allowed                | `CASE(Priority,"High",1,"Low",0,0)=1` | Priority High hui → error                     |

