## 🟢 2️⃣ FIELD VALUE CHECK FUNCTIONS

| Function    | Easy Meaning      | What it Validates       | Rule Example                    | **Example Explained**              |
| ----------- | ----------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| ISBLANK()   | Field khali       | Mandatory field filled  | `ISBLANK(Phone)`                | Phone empty chhoda → error         |
| ISNUMBER()  | Number check      | Sirf digits allowed     | `NOT(ISNUMBER(Employee_ID__c))` | Employee ID mein letters → error   |
| ISPICKVAL() | Picklist check    | Correct option selected | `ISPICKVAL(Status,"Closed")`    | Status Closed select kiya → error  |
| INCLUDES()  | Multi picklist    | Required option chosen  | `INCLUDES(Skills__c,"Sales")`   | Skills mein Sales selected → error |
| TEXT()      | Text conversion   | Text compare ho raha    | `TEXT(Quantity__c)="10"`        | Quantity exactly 10 hai → error    |
| VALUE()     | Number conversion | Numeric comparison      | `VALUE(Text_Number__c)>100`     | Text value 100 se zyada → error    |

---

## 🟢 3️⃣ TEXT VALIDATION FUNCTIONS

| Function        | Easy Meaning | What it Validates     | Rule Example                            | **Example Explained**           |
| --------------- | ------------ | --------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| REGEX()         | Format check | Email/phone format    | `NOT(REGEX(Email,".*@.*\\.com"))`       | Email format galat → error      |
| CONTAINS()      | Word present | Restricted word block | `CONTAINS(Description,"Free")`          | Description mein “Free” → error |
| BEGINS()        | Start text   | Prefix correct        | `BEGINS(AccountNumber,"ACT")`           | Account no ACT se start → error |
| LEN()           | Length check | Fixed length rule     | `LEN(Aadhar__c)!=12`                    | Aadhar 12 digit nahi → error    |
| LOWER()/UPPER() | Case check   | Case standard         | `UPPER(Country__c)!="INDIA"`            | Country India nahi → error      |
| LEFT()          | Left text    | Starting digits       | `LEFT(Phone,2)!="91"`                   | Phone +91 se start nahi → error |
| RIGHT()         | Right text   | Ending character      | `RIGHT(PAN__c,1)!="A"`                  | PAN A se end nahi → error       |
| MID()           | Middle text  | Middle digits         | `MID(Phone,4,3)="000"`                  | Phone mein 000 → error          |
| TRIM()          | Space remove | Extra spaces block    | `LEN(TRIM(Name))<3`                     | Name sirf spaces → error        |
| SUBSTITUTE()    | Replace text | Invalid char remove   | `CONTAINS(SUBSTITUTE(Name," ",""),"@")` | Name mein @ → error             |

---

## 🟢 4️⃣ DATE & TIME FUNCTIONS

| Function        | Easy Meaning  | What it Validates | Rule Example                              | **Example Explained**           |
| --------------- | ------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| DATE()          | Date banana   | Date range        | `CloseDate>DATE(2026,1,1)`                | Close date 2026 ke baad → error |
| DATEVALUE()     | Date extract  | Date compare      | `DATEVALUE(CreatedDate)=TODAY()`          | Aaj hi record bana → error      |
| DATETIMEVALUE() | Text→DateTime | Valid datetime    | `DATETIMEVALUE("2025-01-01 12:00")<NOW()` | Past datetime → error           |
| TODAY()         | Aaj ki date   | Past/future block | `CloseDate<TODAY()`                       | Past close date → error         |
| NOW()           | Current time  | Expired record    | `Expiry__c<NOW()`                         | Expiry ho chuki → error         |
| DAY()           | Day number    | Specific day      | `DAY(TODAY())=1`                          | Month ka 1st day → error        |
| MONTH()         | Month         | Month restriction | `MONTH(TODAY())=1`                        | January mein save → error       |
| YEAR()          | Year          | Year check        | `YEAR(CloseDate)<YEAR(TODAY())`           | Purana year → error             |
| WEEKDAY()       | Week day      | Weekend block     | `WEEKDAY(TODAY())=1`                      | Sunday par save → error         |

---

## 🟢 5️⃣ MATH FUNCTIONS

| Function   | Easy Meaning   | What it Validates  | Rule Example                    | **Example Explained**           |
| ---------- | -------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| ABS()      | Minus→Plus     | Absolute limit     | `ABS(Balance__c)>5000`          | Balance ±5000 se zyada → error  |
| CEILING()  | Round up       | Upper limit        | `CEILING(Amount)>100`           | Round hone ke baad >100 → error |
| FLOOR()    | Round down     | Min limit          | `FLOOR(Amount)<10`              | Round ke baad <10 → error       |
| ROUND()    | Normal round   | Decimal precision  | `ROUND(Amount,2)>999.99`        | 2 decimal ke baad limit cross   |
| SQRT()     | Square root    | Size logic         | `SQRT(Area__c)>50`              | Area bahut zyada → error        |
| MAX()      | Max value      | Upper threshold    | `MAX(Price1__c,Price2__c)>1000` | Koi price >1000 → error         |
| MIN()      | Min value      | Minimum marks      | `MIN(Mark1__c,Mark2__c)<35`     | Fail marks → error              |
| MOD()      | Remainder      | Even/Odd logic     | `MOD(Quantity__c,2)!=0`         | Quantity odd → error            |
| LOG()      | Log value      | Advanced numeric   | `LOG(Amount)>3`                 | Log limit cross                 |
| MCEILING() | Currency round | Financial rounding | `MCEILING(Amount__c)>1000`      | Rounded amount >1000            |

---

## 🟢 6️⃣ CHANGE & ADVANCED FUNCTIONS

| Function       | Easy Meaning  | What it Validates       | Rule Example                                       | **Example Explained**     |
| -------------- | ------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| ISCHANGED()    | Value change  | Restricted field change | `ISCHANGED(StageName)`                             | Stage change kiya → error |
| PRIORVALUE()   | Old value     | Value downgrade         | `PRIORVALUE(Amount)>Amount`                        | Amount kam kiya → error   |
| VLOOKUP()      | Cross object  | Related data rule       | `VLOOKUP(Product__c,Discount__c,Rate__c,FALSE)>20` | Discount >20%             |
| GETSESSIONID() | Session info  | Valid session           | `NOT(ISBLANK(GETSESSIONID()))`                     | Session active            |
| ADDMONTHS()    | Date + months | Duration limit          | `EndDate__c<ADDMONTHS(StartDate__c,12)`            | 12 months se pehle end    |

